 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早上好呀。",
   "raw_sha256": "5b665f592e75c406bf57ba20db3073099d8ed0a7b0ce7a534e5f7d314259205c",
   "seconds": 2.218,
   "pause_ms": 480
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今天的阳光已经悄悄爬上窗台了。",
   "raw_sha256": "e958eb2fd3801f4001638186086148739f82dbd20ca33a0d771e324cf764b047",
   "seconds": 3.342,
   "pause_ms": 480
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你昨天交代的事情，我都放在心上。",
   "raw_sha256": "14808c392572b6c0d3349e860753288e1c6c4aa007b2c939d7655aca0b86447b",
   "seconds": 3.871,
   "pause_ms": 480
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今天先别急着忙，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "8abe295ea849edb43876ab614f5ad5fde5adf978c7c31f3b1630b2c10715ce28",
   "seconds": 4.373,
   "pause_ms": 480
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "告诉我，你昨晚睡得怎么样？",
   "raw_sha256": "c4f1af30c0ab7fd53a6344496d1b271fdcbf099b58ce744aac885424302ffdc4",
   "seconds": 3.082,
   "pause_ms": 480
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "要是还想赖床，我就轻轻陪你聊一会儿。",
   "raw_sha256": "d8492e21a5f455694b121e7bed04773ccef554570bf9180856647b133fae0875",
   "seconds": 4.342,
   "pause_ms": 480
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你准备好了，我们再一起看看今天最重要的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "c2dcdde0cca955419896dad944a3810d3cc05336638c788f5705a0bd32019cc9",
   "seconds": 5.443,
   "pause_ms": 480
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，我就安静；",
   "raw_sha256": "1e48f4782e4e8aa7c75ba21e1c666336dba6ea32f2ce45c6cfceea8296c15a58",
   "seconds": 2.605,
   "pause_ms": 336
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，我就陪你慢慢说。",
   "raw_sha256": "4fcf62853a4efeb6882db376375bf34dcba040e75c7c18d17537d927d3df314e",
   "seconds": 3.264,
   "pause_ms": 480
  }
 ],
